    },
    {
      "text": "こうげきと　どうじに　もちものを\nぬすむ。　じぶんに　もちものが\nあると　しっぱいする。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "공격과 동시에 도구를 훔친다.\n자신이 도구를 지니고 있을 경우에는\n훔칠 수 없다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur attaque la cible et vole son objet.\nLe lanceur ne peut rien voler s’il tient déjà\nun objet.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Der Anwender greift an und stiehlt dem Ziel\ngleichzeitig ein Item, sofern er selbst gerade\nkein Item trägt.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Impide que el objetivo utilice el objeto que lleve\ny que su Entrenador use objetos sobre él.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa attacca il bersaglio e può rubargli\nlo strumento, se non ne ha già uno.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user attacks and steals the target’s\nheld item simultaneously. The user can’t\nsteal anything if it already holds an item.",
