        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "だいのじの　ほのおで\nあいてを　やきつくす。\nやけど　じょうたいに　することが　ある。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "큰 대자의 불꽃으로\n상대를 불태운다.\n화상 상태로 만들 때가 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "用大字形狀的火焰燒盡對手。\n有時會讓對手陷入灼傷狀態。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un déluge de flammes ardentes submerge l’ennemi.\nPeut aussi le brûler.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Feuersbrunst, die das Ziel versengt und ihm\neventuell eine Verbrennung zufügt.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Llama intensa que chamusca y puede causar\nquemaduras.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Investe il bersaglio con un’intensa fiammata\nche fa terra bruciata. Può anche scottarlo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The target is attacked with an intense blast of\nall-consuming fire. This may also leave the target\nwith a burn.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "大の字の　炎で\n相手を　焼きつくす。\nやけど状態に　することが　ある。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "用大字形状的火焰烧尽对手。\n有时会让对手陷入灼伤状态。",
